    <div class="tab" data-group="primary" data-tab="tensai"><section class="sns-tensai-panel">
      <h2>TENSAI (GENIUS)</h2><p><strong>Restricted Hijutsu framework.</strong> Choose Versatility or Hibon Ninpou; purchase limited and special aptitudes separately. At most 2 different Special Aptitudes; their level-2 upgrades do not use extra slots. Clan-linked references retain their original associations and requirements.</p>
      {{#if tensaiError}}<p role="alert">{{tensaiError}} Reopen the sheet to retry.</p>{{/if}}
      {{#if tensaiPowers}}<p><strong>Owned power entries:</strong> {{#each tensaiPowers}}{{name}} — level {{level}} ({{route}}); {{/each}}</p>{{else}}<p>No owned Versatility or Hibon Ninpou power was detected. All reference cards remain readable.</p>{{/if}}
      <p>Level filters refer to Versatility progression. Special Aptitude levels are stated on their individual cards; do not confuse them with Versatility levels. Viewing this tab does not grant powers or aptitudes.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Tensai aptitude sections" style="display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:10px 0"><button type="button" data-tensai-section="" aria-pressed="true">All Tensai</button><button type="button" data-tensai-section="Restricted Aptitude" aria-pressed="false">Restricted Aptitudes</button><button type="button" data-tensai-section="special" aria-pressed="false">Special Aptitudes</button></nav>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap"><label>Level <select data-tensai-filter="level"><option value="">All levels</option><option value="0">Core rules and aptitude references</option>{{#each tensaiGroups}}<option value="{{level}}">Versatility level {{level}}</option>{{/each}}</select></label><label>Category <select data-tensai-filter="kind"><option value="">All categories</option><option>Rules</option><option>Versatility</option><option>Power Route</option><option>Restricted Aptitude</option><option value="special">Special Aptitudes + Clan References</option><option>Special Aptitude</option><option>Clan Reference</option><option>Technique</option><option>Level Choice</option></select></label><label>Search <input type="search" data-tensai-filter="query" placeholder="Find an aptitude, rule or technique"></label></div>
      <section class="sns-tensai-group"><h3>Rules, Aptitudes and Techniques</h3>{{#each tensaiRules}}<details class="sns-tensai-entry sns-box" data-tensai-level="0" data-tensai-kind="{{kind}}" data-tensai-rule="{{id}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}} — {{kind}}</summary><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> {{prerequisites}}{{#if clan}} · <strong>Clan source:</strong> {{clan}}{{/if}}</p><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>
      {{#each tensaiGroups}}<section class="sns-tensai-group"><h3>Versatility Level {{level}}</h3>{{#each entries}}<details class="sns-tensai-entry sns-box" data-tensai-level="{{level}}" data-tensai-kind="{{kind}}" data-tensai-rule="{{id}}" style="margin:8px 0;padding:8px"><summary style="cursor:pointer;font-weight:bold">{{name}} — {{kind}}</summary><p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> {{prerequisites}}</p><p style="white-space:pre-line">{{description}}</p><small>Basic Book, pp. {{pageText}}</small></details>{{/each}}</section>{{/each}}
      <p>Effect choices, special-aptitude slots, power purchases, chakra costs, seals and Hiraishin movement are resolved manually. Refer to the original clan sections for clan-specific eligibility.</p>
    </section></div>
